{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.EmCouplingProjection","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.EmCouplingProjection","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.isEmCoupling_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.isEmCoupling_iff","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/EmCouplingProjection.lean#L83-L89","doc":"The defining relation with the crossing-number indices and the\nantisymmetric eigenvalue unfolded: `[9]_q · [10]_q · α = q⁻¹`.  Holds\nby definitional unfolding (`strongCrossingNumber = 9`,\n`weakCrossingNumber = 10`, `antisymmetricEigenvalue = q_inv`). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:em-coupling-projection","label":"prop:em-coupling-projection","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/em-coupling-projection.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IsEmCoupling","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IsEmCoupling","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/EmCouplingProjection.lean#L58-L81","doc":"**Electromagnetic coupling projection** (Proposition).\n\nThe fine-structure constant is the τ-trace of the antisymmetric\nbraiding component normalised by the force-carrier crossing\ncomplexities,\n\n  α_EM = q⁻¹ / ([9]_q · [10]_q),\n\nstated **division-free over ℤ[q, q⁻¹]** as the cleared-denominator\nrelation `α` satisfies:\n\n  [9]_q · [10]_q · α = q⁻¹.\n\nThe formula factorises into three layers:\n1. Charge (discrete, from writhe): `Q_q(K) = [w(K)]_q`.\n2. Coupling strength (R-matrix): `|tr_τ(σ_anti)|² = q⁻¹`.\n3. Normalisation by force-carrier complexity: `[9]_q · [10]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.antisymmetricEigenvalue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.antisymmetricEigenvalue","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/EmCouplingProjection.lean#L53-L56","doc":"The antisymmetric eigenvalue of the R-matrix for `SU_q(2)`:\n`|tr_τ(σ_anti)|² = q⁻¹`.  This is the genuine ring element\n`q_inv = T(-1) ∈ ℤ[q, q⁻¹]`, **not** a field inverse. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.weakCrossingNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.weakCrossingNumber","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/EmCouplingProjection.lean#L49-L51","doc":"Crossing number of the weak force carrier `T_{3,5}` (as a ℤ index\nfor `qInt`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.strongCrossingNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.strongCrossingNumber","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/EmCouplingProjection.lean#L45-L47","doc":"Crossing number of the strong force carrier `T_{2,9}` (as a ℤ index\nfor `qInt`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}